cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the data or the code of VN1, please cite the competition."
type: dataset
title: "VN1 Forecasting – Accuracy Challenge"
abstract: >-
  Weekly sales and prices of 15,053 product-warehouse combinations from 46 e-vendors, from July 2020
  to April 2024, from the VN1 forecasting competition of 2024. With the official scoring code, the
  two benchmarks and the five winning forecasts.
